105 |    * subscription to a any subscription will result in no operation. (A noop).
106 |    *
107 |    * Adding a subscription to itself, or adding `null` or `undefined` will not perform any
108 |    * operation at all. (A noop).
109 |    *
110 |    * `Subscription` instances that are added to this instance will automatically remove themselves
111 |    * if they are unsubscribed. Functions and {@link Unsubscribable} objects that you wish to remove
112 |    * will need to be removed manually with {@link #remove}
